;
RCP/M CALLER HELP

Type HELP followed by a topic, for example: HELP GAMES
DIR HELP: lists the topic files. Upper or lower case is fine.

COMMANDS   Basic commands and named directories
MOUNT      Select a J: collection or P: archive
LIBRARY    Browse archive libraries and read their members
TRANSFER   Download files or submit an upload
RBBS       Enter the bulletin board
CHAT       Page the sysop for a live conversation
GAMES      Play the supplied online games
WORK       Temporary workspace and file permissions
LOGOFF     End the call or leave a message for the sysop

Type HELP // for the preserved viewer's own usage information.
